  "dcterms:title": "Genotyping-by-sequencing dataset of egg-bearing female American lobsters from Atlantic Canada",
  "dcterms:description": "This dataset contains unfiltered genotyping-by-sequencing genotypes at 41 210 SNPs for 288 egg-bearing female American lobsters (Homarus americanus) from the Gulf of St. Lawrence, Newfoundland and the Bay of Fundy region (Canada). DNA was extracted from walking legs. The same lobsters were also genotyped by targeted sequencing (Rapture) in a separate dataset (homame6); sample labels do not always agree between the two datasets, and genotype matching links each lobster across both.",
